codex
The regenerated `.mpy` is byte-identical to the submission. The independent 30,054-case run found zero mismatches against the literal prompt contract, but 73 mismatches against the trusted canonical—including ordinary valid dates such as `01-31-2000`. Inspection shows the canonical’s unparenthesized February condition rejects every day above 29, regardless of month; I’ll carry that prompt/canonical conflict into the final adequacy judgment. Next is the clean LLVM/Haskell reconstruction and per-claim proof run.
