The fresh LLVM build and concrete execution succeeded. One extra AST-identity probe I added hit a parser-level representation detail: `.Stmts` is accepted inside the K rule RHS but not by the standalone program parser. I’m preserving that failed diagnostic and will rerun the identity check after converting only those explicit empty-list terminals to the equivalent omitted concrete form; it does not affect the ongoing proof reconstruction.
